<!--
    The NBTApps mark: an N whose diagonal is an amber road, widening towards the viewer, and whose right
    upright is an arrow down into the car. Drawn on the 108dp adaptive-icon grid, then scaled to 82% about
    its own centre (57, 54) and moved onto the icon's (54, 54), which leaves room inside the 66dp safe zone.
    nbtapps.com's favicon.svg and Logo.astro carry the same paths.
-->
